  "Automation, report and calibration requirements": "自动化、报告及校准要求",
  "Mobile EV Charger Commissioning and Maintenance Workflow": "移动式充电桩调试与维护流程",
  "Field operations": "现场作业",
  "A field workflow for bringing the correct charger interface, measurement tools and repeatable evidence process to installed charging sites.": "将匹配的充电接口、测量工具与可重复记录流程带到已安装充电现场的作业方案。",
  "This mobile workflow supports commissioning, maintenance and fault isolation when a charger cannot be moved to a fixed laboratory. The project configuration must match the installed connector and ratings, define how charging energy will be handled and keep the field record within the checks actually executed.": "此移动流程支持无法搬入固定实验室的充电桩开展调试、维护和故障定位。项目配置须匹配已安装接口与额定参数，明确充电能量处理方式，并如实记录实际执行的检查范围。",
  "Charging station operators": "充电站运营商",
  "Commissioning and maintenance contractors": "调试与维护服务商",
  "Manufacturer field service teams": "制造商现场服务团队",
