  "Compare site behavior with a known commissioning baseline": "将现场表现与已知调试基线比较",
  "Preserve evidence needed for repair confirmation or laboratory escalation": "保留维修确认或转交实验室分析所需的记录",
  "Mobile test platform": "移动测试平台",
