  "Simulates the required GB/T, CCS2, CHAdeMO, Type 1 or Type 2 vehicle-side workflow.": "模拟所需 GB/T、CCS2、CHAdeMO、Type 1 或 Type 2 车辆侧流程。",
  "Approved energy path": "已确认的能量路径",
  "Uses a compatible external load or other approved arrangement where sustained power transfer is required.": "需要持续功率传输时，使用兼容的外部负载或其他已批准方案。",
  "Field evidence package": "现场记录包",
  "Records charger identity, tester configuration, measurements, messages and the result of each planned check.": "记录充电桩身份、测试仪配置、测量、报文及各计划检查项的结果。",
  "Prepare from site information": "依据现场资料准备",
  "Confirm charger model, connector, rating, supply, access, visit purpose and available load before dispatch.": "出发前确认充电桩型号、连接器、额定值、供电、通行条件、到访目的与可用负载。",
  "Complete safety preconditions": "完成安全前置检查",
  "Follow the site procedure for visual, grounding, supply and connector checks before functional testing.": "功能测试前，按现场流程完成外观、接地、供电和连接器检查。",
  "Run the normal sequence": "执行正常序列",
  "Observe connection, readiness, charging, measured output and controlled stop using a repeatable baseline.": "依据可重复基线观察连接、就绪、充电、实测输出与受控停止。",
  "Investigate the reported condition": "调查反馈问题",
  "Change only the condition required to reproduce the issue and retain surrounding protocol and measurement evidence.": "仅改变复现问题所必需的条件，并保留前后协议与测量记录。",
  "Confirm handover or escalation": "确认交接或升级分析",
  "Repeat affected checks after repair, or preserve the configuration and first divergent state for laboratory reproduction.": "维修后重复受影响的检查，或保留配置与首个偏离状态供实验室复现。",
