  "Site and charger identity record": "现场与充电桩身份记录",
  "Links the visit to the installed asset, connector, ratings, firmware, backend configuration and reason for testing.": "将本次作业关联至已安装设备、连接器、额定值、固件、后台配置和测试原因。",
  "Safety and load precondition checklist": "安全与负载前置检查清单",
  "Shows that supply, grounding, cables, access controls and the energy-absorption path matched the planned work.": "说明供电、接地、电缆、通行控制和能量吸收路径符合计划作业要求。",
  "Baseline and post-work comparison": "基线与作业后对比",
  "Compares the same charging states and measured values before and after repair, maintenance or configuration changes.": "比较维修、维护或配置变更前后相同充电状态与测量值。",
  "Escalation package": "升级分析资料包",
  "Preserves the last completed state, logs, measurements and site limitations needed for laboratory reproduction.": "保留实验室复现所需的最后完成状态、日志、测量和现场限制。",
  "Installed connector and charger rating": "已安装连接器与充电桩额定值",
  "Permitted field tests and site safety controls": "获准的现场测试与安全措施",
  "External load or energy-absorption arrangement": "外部负载或能量吸收方案",
  "Required acceptance report and escalation process": "所需验收报告与升级分析流程",
  "EVSE Production End-of-Line and Aging Test Architecture": "充电设备生产线终检与老化测试架构",
  "Factory testing": "工厂测试",
  "A modular production architecture for repeatable charger identity, functional, communication and power checks with traceable result handling.": "模块化生产测试架构，支持可重复的充电桩身份、功能、通信及功率检查，以及可追溯的结果管理。",
  "This production architecture separates fast, stable end-of-line decisions from deeper laboratory diagnosis and longer aging duties. Each station should be configured around the charger variants, cycle-time target, measurable limits, fixtures and data interface required by the manufacturer.": "此生产架构将快速稳定的线末判定与深入实验室诊断及长时间老化分开。每个工位应根据充电桩变型、节拍目标、可测限值、工装和制造商所需数据接口进行配置。",
  "AC and DC charger manufacturers": "交直流充电桩制造商",
  "Production engineering teams": "生产工程团队",
  "Quality and manufacturing data teams": "质量与制造数据团队",
  "Detect assembly, configuration and calibration issues with stable pass or fail limits": "通过稳定的合格判定限值发现装配、配置及校准问题",
  "Keep operator actions and variant selection controlled": "控制操作员动作与产品变型选择",
  "Link measurements and retest history to the charger identity": "将测量与复测历史关联到充电桩身份",
  "End-of-line test station": "生产线终检工位",
  "Runs product-specific identity, safety precondition, interface, communication and measured-output checks.": "执行产品对应的身份、安全前置条件、接口、通信和实测输出检查。",
  "Connector fixtures and switching": "连接器工装与切换",
  "Provides controlled, rated connections for each supported charger variant.": "为每种支持的充电桩变型提供受控且额定匹配的连接。",
  "Power and aging equipment": "功率与老化设备",
  "Applies the specified duty profile using separately rated source, load, cooling and protection systems.": "使用分别满足额定要求的电源、负载、冷却和保护系统施加指定工作曲线。",
  "Test control and data interface": "测试控制与数据接口",
  "Selects the correct program and stores measurements, limits, results, versions and authorized retests.": "选择正确程序，并保存测量、限值、结果、版本及获准复测记录。",
  "Map production risks": "梳理生产风险",
  "Select checks that detect likely assembly, wiring, firmware, configuration or calibration defects.": "选择能发现潜在装配、接线、固件、配置或校准缺陷的检查项。",
  "Define station limits": "定义工位限值",
  "Set initial conditions, stimulus, measurement, numeric acceptance limit and evidence for each product variant.": "为各产品变型规定初始条件、激励、测量、数值验收限值及记录。",
  "Validate fixtures and references": "验证工装与参考件",
  "Use controlled reference units and fixture checks to establish repeatability across stations and shifts.": "通过受控参考件与工装检查，建立跨工位、跨班次的重复性。",
  "Sequence for cycle time": "按节拍安排顺序",
  "Run identity and fast preconditions before longer communication, power or aging operations.": "先执行身份与快速前置检查，再开展较长的通信、功率或老化测试。",
  "Control failures and retests": "管控不合格与复测",
  "Route diagnostic work away from the main line and require a recorded reason for repair, retest or override.": "将诊断工作分流至主线外，并记录维修、复测或特殊放行的原因。",
  "Product-variant test matrix": "产品变型测试矩阵",
  "Station acceptance and reference checks": "工位验收与参考检查",
