  "Variant and limit matrix": "变型与限值矩阵",
  "Maps each charger configuration to the correct program, stimulus, measurement, numeric limit and fixture.": "将每种充电桩配置映射到正确的程序、激励、测量、数值限值与工装。",
  "Fixture and reference checks": "工装与参考件检查",
  "Demonstrates that station hardware and controlled reference units remain stable across shifts and maintenance.": "证明工位硬件与受控参考件在不同班次和维护后保持稳定。",
  "Serial-number result record": "序列号结果记录",
  "Links measurements, limits, program version, instruments, timestamp and result to the manufactured charger.": "将测量、限值、程序版本、仪器、时间戳和结果关联至生产的充电桩。",
  "Retest and override history": "复测与特殊放行历史",
  "Provides an auditable reason for repair, repeat testing or authorized disposition without hiding first-pass failures.": "提供可审计的维修、重复测试或授权处置原因，不隐藏首次测试不合格记录。",
