  "CCS Protocol Tester for CCS2 DC Fast Charger Testing": "用于 CCS2 直流快充测试的 CCS 协议测试仪",
  "Select a CCS protocol tester for CCS2 DC fast charger tests covering PLC communication, ISO 15118 or DIN workflows, electrical response and external loads.": "选择用于 CCS2 直流快充的 CCS 协议测试仪，覆盖 PLC 通信、ISO 15118 或 DIN 流程、电气响应与外部负载。",
  "CCS2 DC fast charger testing": "CCS2 直流快充测试",
