  "Retain evidence for diagnosis and comparison": "保留用于诊断与比较的记录",
  "Compare the complete setup, not only the tester rating": "比较完整配置，而非仅比较测试仪额定值",
  "Send these inputs with a CCS protocol tester enquiry so the quotation can distinguish included functions, options and external equipment.": "咨询 CCS 协议测试仪时提供这些信息，以便报价区分包含功能、选项和外部设备。",
