  "NACS AC EVSE Testing: Pilot States & Field Evidence": "NACS 交流充电设备测试：导引状态与现场记录",
  "Plan NACS AC EVSE tests around SAE J3400, pilot states, electrical ratings, switching, measurements, faults and repeatable field evidence.": "围绕 SAE J3400、导引状态、电气额定值、开关动作、测量、故障和可重复现场记录规划 NACS 交流测试。",
  "NACS AC EVSE testing": "NACS 交流充电设备测试",
