  "Type 2 AC EVSE Testing for IEC 61851 Workflows": "面向 IEC 61851 流程的 Type 2 交流测试",
  "Plan Type 2 AC charging station tests for control-pilot states, proximity detection, switching, metering, faults and field acceptance.": "规划 Type 2 交流充电站的控制导引状态、连接检测、开关动作、计量、故障与现场验收测试。",
  "Type 2 AC EVSE testing": "Type 2 交流充电设备测试",
